    "title": "AdAsia 2019",
    "subtitle": null,
    "summary": "Mr. Shayan Alwani, who is responsible for CIME's business development, had an opportunity to be part of AdAsia Congress 2019. It was a full of learning experience, and showed how we can promote simulation-based education in our society.",
    "media": [
